/*
 * Context object used during macro rewriting.
 *
 * MacroRewriteContext encapsulates all state required while rewriting a
 * macro-generated string. It provides:
 *
 *   - the current MacroMapper(variable bindings),
 *   - the rule index(depth of nested macro rules),
 *   - a unique identifier for this rewriting instance,
 *   - an internal StringStream used to accumulate rewritten output.
 *
 * This context is passed through all rewriting functions and is responsible
 * for producing the final expanded byte sequence.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::macro_::rewrite::model
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/macro_/rewrite/model.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-01
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
